'''Dratini''' (Japanese: '''ミニリュウ''' ''Miniryu'') is a {{ct|Dragon}} Basic Pokémon card in [[Pokémon Trading Card Game Pocket]]. It was first released as part of the {{TCGP|Genetic Apex}} expansion.

